    "description": "A classic-style falling block puzzle game. It shares some code with the author's earlier terminal game, termtris, and keeps a high score table with name entry. The background music is a short loop from Greig Stewart's laser harp performance of Korobeiniki.\n\nControls: D-pad left/right moves the block, D-pad down makes it fall faster, B or D-pad up drops it immediately, A rotates it. START pauses, SELECT starts a new game, and L or R toggles the music.",
